# Realm-Scorcher Hellkite cast without bargain: its enters trigger has an intervening "if it was bargained" (CR 603.4), so
# it adds no mana and asks no question. It has haste (attacks the turn it is cast, CR 702.10) and flying (Bot2's Llanowar
# Elves, with neither flying nor reach, cannot block it), so Bot2 takes 4. Afterwards "{1}{R}: deals 1 damage to any target"
# (paid with Black Lotus's {R}{R}{R}, one mana left over) kills the Elves.

